    "extract": "The 2018–19 Oral Roberts Golden Eagles men's basketball team represented Oral Roberts University during the 2018–19 NCAA Division I men's basketball season. The Golden Eagles were led by second-year head coach Paul Mills and played their home games at the Mabee Center in Tulsa, Oklahoma as members of The Summit League.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>2018–19 Oral Roberts Golden Eagles men's basketball team</b> represented Oral Roberts University during the 2018–19 NCAA Division I men's basketball season. The Golden Eagles were led by second-year head coach Paul Mills and played their home games at the Mabee Center in Tulsa, Oklahoma as members of The Summit League.</p>"
